Hedera consensus-layer observer set
source: https://mainnet-public.mirrornode.hedera.com  (unauthenticated)
probe for consensus visibility

========================================================================
1. The address book: every entity that sees a transaction pre-consensus
========================================================================

Every consensus node receives gossiped events, and a hashgraph event
carries an array of transactions, not hashes. So this list IS the
pre-consensus observer set. It is not a subset of it.

